00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:16.450
One of the domain name brands
that Citrix has for many years

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:17.260
is the NetScaler.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:19.089
Now it's called an ADC.

00:04:19.089 --> 00:04:21.220
It's a front end load balancing.

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:24.710
And it's at the core
most of what we do.

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:27.760
And if you look at the top 500
companies around the world,

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:31.630
a lot of them use
the ADC features

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:33.730
