secure gateway,

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:36.190
and many, many other things.

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:39.610
So we have really invested
into this partnership.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:41.740
As you can see from
this slide, there's

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:44.440
a lot of technologies
where we adapt

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:48.850
where Google is going
and adapted into a Citrix

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:50.077
